{"id": "msg_b79808482ba744058517bf6e65d4426e", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-6ce8d022-9fad-40a6-a04b-e64e5ede82c5-168__fc_17a344a5-7332-9ed9-9cce-b91963d9a65b_2", "tool_name": "read", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"<path>D:\\\\WorkBuddy\\\\金瓶梅翻译\\\\translation\\\\output\\\\ch060_seg02.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: 　　春光点染桃花，红了绽开的花蕊；\\n2: 　　风儿欺弄杨柳，翻出绿色的腰肢。\\n3: \\n4: （原文：春点桃花红绽蕊，风欺杨柳绿翻腰。）\\n5: \\n6: 西门庆与郑月儿留恋到三更方才回家。到次日，吴月娘打发他往衙门里去了，自己和玉楼、金莲、李娇儿都在上房坐着。只见玳安进来上房取尺头匣儿，要往夏提刑家送生日礼去。月娘便问玳安：“你爹昨儿坐轿子往谁家吃酒去了，吃到那么晚才回家？想必又是到韩道国家，探望他那老婆去了。原来这贼囚根子成天只瞒着我，背地里替他干这等勾当！”\\n\\n(Showing lines 1-6 of 73. Use offset=7 to continue.)\\n</content>\"}]", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_b79808482ba744058517bf6e65d4426e", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 436, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-03T02:51:18.011Z"}
{"id": "msg_551af76688714b02be4b441ddcc8792c", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-6ce8d022-9fad-40a6-a04b-e64e5ede82c5-169__fc_17a344a5-7332-9ed9-9cce-b91963d9a65b_3", "tool_name": "read", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"<path>D:\\\\WorkBuddy\\\\金瓶梅翻译\\\\translation\\\\output\\\\ch060_seg02.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n45: \\n46: 那李瓶儿不听便罢，听了，正是：\\n47: \\n48: 　　惊损了六叶相连的肝肺，\\n49: 　　吓坏了三毛七孔的心。\\n50: \\n\\n(Showing lines 45-50 of 73. Use offset=51 to continue.)\\n</content>\"}]", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_551af76688714b02be4b441ddcc8792c", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 274, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-03T02:51:18.015Z"}
{"id": "msg_4f79bcadeb484b50bcae9836a31b9ba7", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-6ce8d022-9fad-40a6-a04b-e64e5ede82c5-170__fc_17a344a5-7332-9ed9-9cce-b91963d9a65b_4", "tool_name": "read", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"<path>D:\\\\WorkBuddy\\\\金瓶梅翻译\\\\translation\\\\output\\\\ch060_seg01.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n6: 　　定是毛延寿笔下的美人图。\\n7: \\n8: （原文：若非道子观音画，定然延寿美人图。）\\n9: \\n10: 爱月儿走到下面，朝上不端不正与西门庆道了个万福，就拿洒金扇儿掩着粉脸，坐在旁边。西门庆定睛细看，觉得她比初见时越发齐整，不觉心摇目荡，按捺不住。\\n11: \\n\\n(Showing lines 6-11 of 38. Use offset=12 to continue.)\\n</content>\"}]", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_4f79bcadeb484b50bcae9836a31b9ba7", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 336, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-03T02:51:18.018Z"}
{"id": "msg_bb4f9c764e21464dab87e9287cdae270", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-6ce8d022-9fad-40a6-a04b-e64e5ede82c5-171__fc_17a344a5-7332-9ed9-9cce-b91963d9a65b_5", "tool_name": "read", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"<path>D:\\\\WorkBuddy\\\\金瓶梅翻译\\\\translation\\\\output\\\\ch060_seg00.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n12: 　　珠沉玉殒，往事都已茫茫。\\n13: 　　只有那泪珠能凝成雨，\\n14: 　　纵然倾尽东海，也洗不尽这无边的恨。\\n15: \\n16: （原文：枫叶初丹槲叶黄，河阳愁髩恰新霜。鬼门徒忆空回首，泉路凭谁说断肠？路杳云迷愁漠漠，珠沉玉殒事茫茫。惟有泪珠能结雨，尽倾东海恨无疆。）\\n17: \\n\\n(Showing lines 12-17 of 67. Use offset=18 to continue.)\\n</content>\"}]", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_bb4f9c764e21464dab87e9287cdae270", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 348, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-03T02:51:18.020Z"}
{"id": "msg_91f9324f6c8549c6aa8b3382fb7a36fe", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-6ce8d022-9fad-40a6-a04b-e64e5ede82c5-172__fc_17a344a5-7332-9ed9-9cce-b91963d9a65b_6", "tool_name": "read", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"<path>D:\\\\WorkBuddy\\\\金瓶梅翻译\\\\translation\\\\output\\\\ch060_seg00.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n50: 　　天仙在织机上整理香罗，\\n51: 　　一入手先拖出雪白的一窝。\\n52: 　　不独桃源能够问渡，\\n53: 　　又来月窟陪伴嫦娥。\\n54: \\n55: （原文：天仙机上整香罗，入手先拖雪一窝。不独桃源能问渡，却来月窟伴嫦娥。）\\n\\n(Showing lines 50-55 of 67. Use offset=56 to continue.)\\n</content>\"}]", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_91f9324f6c8549c6aa8b3382fb7a36fe", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 320, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-03T02:51:18.021Z"}
{"id": "msg_f8f6e189ae844716ae36ad96b3f65193", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-6ce8d022-9fad-40a6-a04b-e64e5ede82c5-173__fc_17a344a5-7332-9ed9-9cce-b91963d9a65b_7", "tool_name": "read", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"<path>D:\\\\WorkBuddy\\\\金瓶梅翻译\\\\translation\\\\output\\\\ch060_seg03.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n23: 　　不在阳间擒拿鼠耗，\\n24: 　　却回阴府做了狸仙。\\n25: \\n26: （原文：不在阳间擒鼠耗，却归阴府作狸仙。）\\n27: \\n28: 潘金莲见他把猫拿出去摔死了，坐在炕上纹丝不动。等西门庆出了门，嘴里喃喃呐呐骂道：“贼作死的强盗，把人装出去杀了才算好汉！一个猫儿碍着你什么了？跟凶神似的跑来摔死。它到阴司里，明儿还问你要命，你慌什么？贼不逢好死、变心的强盗！”\\n\\n(Showing lines 23-28 of 40. Use offset=29 to continue.)\\n</content>\"}]", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_f8f6e189ae844716ae36ad96b3f65193", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 390, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-03T02:51:18.023Z"}
